at task.'\",\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 45,\n      \"question\": \"If you're apologizing for a minor inconvenience and the person seems to be over it, what should you say?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A) 'You know I didn't mean any harm.'\",\n        \"B) 'I hope this doesn't cause too much trouble for you.',\"\n        \"C) 'Well, it was just an accident, I can fix it if needed.'\",\n        \"D) 'I should have been more careful next time.'\",\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"A\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
